  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Strawberry Yogurt.png|200px|left|Strawberry Yogurt]]\n\n{{Infobox\n  |level = 105\n  |price = 1 to 529\n  |time = 40 min\n  |xp = 63\n  |source = {{Infoicon|yogurtm|bigger|link=Yogurt Maker}}\n  |base = 147\n  |dia = 3\n  |time3 = 34 min\n  |title = [[Products|product]]\n}}\n\n'''Strawberry yogurt''' is a [[Products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 105. It is not used to make any other product.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making Strawberry Yogurt'''===\n[[File:Yogurt Maker.png|150px|left|Yogurt Maker]]\nStrawberry yogurt is made in the [[Yogurt Maker]].\n\nTo make the strawberry yogurt, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Plain Yogurt.png|75px|Plain yogurt|link=Plain Yogurt]]\n|[[File:Strawberry Jam.png|75px|Strawberry Jam|link=Strawberry Jam]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 40 minutes to make one bowl, and 34 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] yogurt maker. Each yogurt gives players 63 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Selling Strawberry yogurt'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Strawberry yogurt can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 5292 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 bowls.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a strawberry yogurt costs 504 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 2 strawberry yogurt per crate, up to a total of 6 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Erdbeerjoghurt\n|es = Yogurt de fresa\n|fr = Yaourt aux Fraises\n|it = Yogurt alla fragola\n|nl = Aardbeienyoghurt\n|no = Jordbæryoghurt\n|ru = Клубничный йогурт\n|zh = Strawberry Yogurt\n}}\n[[pt-br:Iogurte de morango]]\n\n[[Category:Yogurt Maker Products]]\n[[Category:Plain Yogurt Products]]\n[[Category:Strawberry Jam Products]]",
